{"author":{"id":"6c7374a500bfd4cb191ae45b3f9d4b7a3d9d7f0324d04add217e8cbefeb7e1b9"},"ops":[{"type":3,"timestamp":1791795583,"nonce":"c6qPC32fh2Cdp2jRm2ud6EDe29M=","message":"Implemented and committed locally as 125cfa9 (follows gizmo milestone af5504a / c16e24c).\n\n- Selection3D.draw(id, ctx, draw) decorates the actual object's mesh/model draws. Original vertices, materials, textures and shader behavior are preserved. Both SceneGizmos and Studio3D use it; the README documents it.\n- Material.selected uses the spare normal-matrix component of the existing 16-row mesh draw buffer. MeshShader applies a 12% surface mask and soft geometric rim after presentation, without changing lighting, alpha cutouts or bloom emission. No additional mesh pipeline or render target.\n- SelectionEdges is an Overlay ScenePass that shares the scene's depth. It draws visible silhouettes and creases with constant screen width; GPU edge buffers, settings, bindings and the static HXSL shader pipeline are cached. Deselection drops geometry; owner disposal drops all resources. No timer or idle polling.\n- Position welding joins normal/UV seams, including trigonometric zero residue, without rounding uploaded fractional endpoints. Coplanar triangle diagonals are suppressed. Texture cutouts, blended materials and custom vertex shaders skip geometry edge lines; their surface mask/rim follows MeshShader.fragment when inherited.\n\nVerification: tests/run.sh render passed all 396 checks, including the existing 80 gizmo input checks and 21 new selection geometry/pixel checks at 1x and 2x. Verified mask strength, unchanged unselected pixels, exact restoration on deselection, foreground occlusion, clear torus holes, curved silhouettes without UV seam lines, fractional coordinates, owner cleanup and no idle redraw/hooks.\n\nDirectly inspected offscreen captures: .ashui/snapshots/scene-gizmos.png, Studio3D-selected.png and scene-selection-2x.png. Final integrated log: .ashui/snapshots/selection-highlight-tests.log. Native dependencies unchanged. Code and tracker remain local; no push.","files":null}]}